71d4b6ee1fa1a391c0e5642bcf4bfc423","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0e1257ddd5a31804a5a527cf91b6382612c58e9d5ceb1a12b5659f401846e69f","logical_entry_identity":"12995a8fbbbb862db736e1221bcd922fec6d1a5c450164313f89d195dbd9963c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Whenever you would be affected by a detrimental physical effect you instead transfer it instantly to one of your ghouls.\n\t\tThe ghoul dies from the process.\n\t\tWhile under 1 life it also affects magical and mental effects.\n\t\tAt most %d effects can be affected per turn.\n\t\tCross-tier effects are never affected.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"当你即将受到一个物理负面效果时，你自动将其转移到你的食尸鬼身上。\n\t\t这一食尸鬼会在这个过程中立刻死亡。\n\t\t当你的生命值低于 1 时，你也会转移魔法和精神负面效果。\n\t\t每回合最多转移 %d 个效果。\n\t\t不会转移越层负面效果（失去平衡，法术冲击和思维封锁）。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c2d68562ca924698e915fbd0003e73db0a749966ba316e6c63f73a3dde93e531","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0e139ca1b21a97fe454dc3cb98e70516baf9888970532d4affe5095221d5bbb7","logical_entry_identity":"23d413e00e7adca6cea8c7993473a1e0d90df73104d6248be622045544f0f432","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You cannot use Flurry without dual wielding!","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你只有在双持状态下才能使用这个技能！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"53859b77bdc696a88a74d8c7225c2a328f39e7befdd17299f03ebe5f4ae2fa80","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0e166860d14c6fae4ee9fece08351316c67f703c6b47b96bf2861faf18a153f2","logical_entry_identity":"8dd0eb830b69bcb5034dae897030d1b0ed0f278301bc265945727dd26fa645d3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Using your connection to Nature, you can see your surrounding area in a radius of %d.\n\t\tAlso, while meditating, you are able to detect the presence of creatures around you in a radius of %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"利用你与大自然的联系，你可以查看自身周围 %d 码半径范围的区域。\n\t\t同时，当你处于冥想状态时，你还可以查看自身周围 %d 码半径范围中怪物的位置。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cc54c42a27be4aefb987ec8c82f5246dacfc32ad74c5ce746a99bbab3187daa5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0e17af2fa908f500056087789ae8cefb03c49a00c6e4f631f38af1452493245d","logical_entry_identity":"46bdbf67cb7348e9a68cd4ddab88dfaf8777179e8734b9478e72ffe109d7a603","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"suffocating","source_tag":"_t","target":"窒息"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7ee042c743bda4b99e97f49c9de56a5c4a411a3cae0b0f5f11ffad6ece7ff49c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0e1b6cf88f68d7b72633f1433184757a6cd0a3e00218d8a307e3e1114e4e439a","logical_entry_identity":"76fd733707aed25ae0b08c0e8f246629d83792e5978d3aeaf6eed6dc3d64057c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"pestilent waraxe","source_tag":"_t","target":"散发着瘟疫气息的斧头"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"50d462fa8a1849a2d792de3714c509cb3680abc0e7a8a9849aedf3f5e84b7a55","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0e1bcedda6a6b135debf478b6c2342b055d4eb5fd55fb5ca3ca5994cd4b8d116","logical_entry_identity":"39e36a9b7486ed544a44b2da369ab17678fa11d2962e9217de8df45af02cb2a7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Echoes of the future flash before your eyes, allowing you to sense some incoming attacks.\n\t\tIf the attack is not physical, you will erect a temporary shield that reduces all damage of this type by %d%% for 5 turns.\n\t\tThis effect can only happen once every 5 turns, and happens before damage is taken.\n\t\tThe bonus will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的眼前会闪烁未来的景象，让你能够预知对你的攻击。\n\t\t如果攻击造成的不是物理伤害，你会创造一道临时护盾，使此类伤害降低 %d%%，持续 5 回合。\n\t\t此效果每隔 5 回合只能触发一次，且在承受伤害前被激活。\n\t\t效果受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e329fcff6f99133f6a2bcf2e573b4c076848fdbdb580cb44edd85d314b9b4bf9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0e1d3ba4d42197dc4ccceff86d9956604a97f6abeea163df6b379b1866fee02b","logical_entry_identity":"5d9a2b19372f1f83080ecdb4cfafa560a9258c9dbbb550ff2d41cd4409513480","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Magically returns %d%% of any damage done to the attacker.","source_tag":"tformat","target"