":"_t","target":"一个厚重的钢护喉，旨在保护其穿着者颈部免受致命攻击。这个特殊的护喉是半身人将军丹纳斯·坦德莫恩在烈火战争中佩戴过的，上面的各种伤痕表明其可能救过这位将军不止一次。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"46656f619e4888e50a984a99f3f6afbbb8a69152acfb3ffa9cdf04ef2cd06396","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0e40051f9066c9c9b80f78d53fdf35232a7ed2215fda9d2f61b8b0ad785cbfb6","logical_entry_identity":"5dccecb99248f9035c32ad5d8153b92185157aea1424a14db739bcada437dd24","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Give order to character 6","source_tag":"_t","target":"发布指令：角色6"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6dd07f67dbf06049545c58ae8f1b3239efa20ac240cafc889e3ea09d5b49b97e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0e428ecb6304774d65679bfc37d0880a64e1da6fe02c18e679fc550e04b4801e","logical_entry_identity":"1534015bb580839c317c8f543f189225fc93d2d164e273ee00309138b4932939","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE#Weakdamage mode ON","source_tag":"log","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE#弱伤害模式：开启"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"83cec91a7aa4b7d0ab25545c9f638aa8f20b7c9956261982b59feecaf71ef97f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0e4632a48a2ef2c1aaa00a4d1cb5c5dcfb6ae7c57240711e66ec7f63b3dda901","logical_entry_identity":"9e5a819154c4fcce90337c13f4cb75edc246d044c2fa8f1e19908980e958cf5d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"When you're targeted by a projectile, your global speed is increased by %d%% for 1 turn.  Taking any action other than movement will break the effect.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"当你被抛射物锁定时，增加你 %d%% 全局速度 1 回合。\n\t\t除了移动外的任何动作均会打破此效果。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}}